# Prettier is deliberately scoped to src/styles/**/*.css ONLY.
#
# The .tsx in this repo uses a dense one-statement-per-line house style, consistently, across
# ~40 files. Reformatting it would destroy git blame on the whole application in a commit that
# changes no behaviour, and it is not the problem: styling lives in CSS (there is exactly one
# inline style in the codebase). The CSS is the problem -- it averaged ~1,100 bytes per line,
# which is why design drift was never visible in review.
#
# gitignore semantics: a file cannot be re-included if a parent directory is excluded, so the
# path down to src/styles must be un-ignored step by step.
/*
!/src
/src/*
!/src/styles
